# 约定(2026-09-23 重写, 对齐 api/inventory/v1 的 proto):
#   直连 = http://{host}:{port}, 身份由 x-md-global-user-id 头模拟网关注入;
#   网关 = {gateway_scheme}://{gateway_host}(LAN) 或 https://{public_gateway_host}(公网), 带 Authorization: Bearer {token}。
#   变量在 http-client.env.json(dev)。host 用 [::1]: 127.0.0.1:30001/30002/30003 被 GoLand/WebStorm/JCEF 占着。

### healthz
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/healthz
Content-Type: application/json

### Reserve
# ⚠️ inventory.stock 当前没有 seed 行(设计上库存由业务流入, 不造假数据), 所以这条预期 "sku_id is not found";
# 要跑通先给 sku 9 建一行库存(见 inventory 迁移 00001 的表结构), 不要在这里改成假 sku。
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/inventory.v1.InventoryService/Reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "{{order_no}}",
  "merchantId": "{{merchant_id}}",
  "items": [{"skuId": {{sku_id}}, "warehouseId": "df0001", "quantity": 1}]
}

### ReleaseReserve(与上面成对)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/inventory.v1.InventoryService/ReleaseReserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNo": "{{order_no}}",
  "merchantId": "{{merchant_id}}",
  "items": [{"skuId": {{sku_id}}, "warehouseId": "df0001", "quantity": 1}]
}
